# Exercises Promotions against the compose stack (`make up`): Staff manage Coupons and Campaigns,
# and Checkout evaluates what a Checkout Session's lines are due. Run the requests top to bottom in the IntelliJ HTTP client; the token requests
# store tokens for the ones after them.

@promotions = http://localhost:8087
@gateway = http://localhost:8000
@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/ecomm/protocol/openid-connect/token

### Staff token
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-cli&username=staff@ecomm.local&password=staff

> {% client.global.set("staffToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Checkout's own token (client credentials; the secret is dev-only)
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=checkout&client_secret=checkout-dev-secret

> {% client.global.set("checkoutToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Customer token
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-cli&username=demo@ecomm.local&password=demo

> {% client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Every Coupon, the seeded WELCOME10 among them
GET {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### A fixed amount off, with a minimum spend; the code is stored upper-case
POST {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "spring25", "discount": {"type": "AMOUNT_OFF", "amountOff": {"amountMinor": 2500, "currency": "EUR"}},
 "minimumSubtotal": {"amountMinor": 10000, "currency": "EUR"},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true}

### The same code again, in any case: 409
POST {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "SPRING25", "discount": {"type": "PERCENT_OFF", "percentOff": 5},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true}

### A percentage past 100: 400, naming discount.percentOff in errors
POST {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "TOOMUCH", "discount": {"type": "PERCENT_OFF", "percentOff": 150},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true}

### Read it back, in any case
GET {{promotions}}/coupons/Spring25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Evaluate it as Checkout on a phone line: 25.00 EUR off, after any Campaign running on phones
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PHN-PIXEL-9-OBSIDIAN-128", "sku": "PHN-PIXEL-9", "category": "phones",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}],
 "couponCode": "spring25"}

### Below its minimum: 422, reason belowMinimum
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PHN-PIXEL-9-OBSIDIAN-128", "sku": "PHN-PIXEL-9", "category": "phones",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 9999, "currency": "EUR"}}],
 "couponCode": "SPRING25"}

### In another currency: 422, reason currencyMismatch
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PHN-PIXEL-9-OBSIDIAN-128", "sku": "PHN-PIXEL-9", "category": "phones",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "USD"}}],
 "couponCode": "SPRING25"}

### Switch it off: replace every field but the code
PUT {{promotions}}/coupons/SPRING25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"discount": {"type": "AMOUNT_OFF", "amountOff": {"amountMinor": 2500, "currency": "EUR"}},
 "minimumSubtotal": {"amountMinor": 10000, "currency": "EUR"},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": false}

### Now 422, reason inactive
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PHN-PIXEL-9-OBSIDIAN-128", "sku": "PHN-PIXEL-9", "category": "phones",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}],
 "couponCode": "SPRING25"}

### The seeded WELCOME10: 10% off, rounded down
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PHN-PIXEL-9-OBSIDIAN-128", "sku": "PHN-PIXEL-9", "category": "phones",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 1001, "currency": "EUR"}}],
 "couponCode": "WELCOME10"}

### An unknown code: 422, reason unknown
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PHN-PIXEL-9-OBSIDIAN-128", "sku": "PHN-PIXEL-9", "category": "phones",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}],
 "couponCode": "NO-SUCH-CODE"}

### A Customer can't evaluate: 403
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PHN-PIXEL-9-OBSIDIAN-128", "sku": "PHN-PIXEL-9", "category": "phones",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}],
 "couponCode": "WELCOME10"}

### Nor manage Coupons: 403
GET {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Through the gateway, Staff reach Coupons
GET {{gateway}}/api/promotions/coupons/WELCOME10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### But evaluation is never routed: 404, whatever the token
POST {{gateway}}/api/promotions/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PHN-PIXEL-9-OBSIDIAN-128", "sku": "PHN-PIXEL-9", "category": "phones",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}],
 "couponCode": "WELCOME10"}

### Delete it: 204, then 404
DELETE {{promotions}}/coupons/SPRING25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###
GET {{promotions}}/coupons/SPRING25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Every Campaign by priority, with its state; the seeded Audio week among them
GET {{promotions}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### A Campaign: 5 EUR off phones over 200 EUR; its ID comes back, and in Location
POST {{promotions}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Phone weekend", "discount": {"type": "AMOUNT_OFF", "amountOff": {"amountMinor": 500, "currency": "EUR"}},
 "categories": ["phones"], "minimumSubtotal": {"amountMinor": 20000, "currency": "EUR"},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true, "priority": 20}

> {% client.global.set("campaignId", response.body.id); %}

### Read it back: state running
GET {{promotions}}/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Audio week's priority: 400, naming priority
POST {{promotions}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Clash", "discount": {"type": "PERCENT_OFF", "percentOff": 5},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true, "priority": 10}

### A Category Catalog doesn't have: 400, naming categories[1]
POST {{promotions}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Toasters", "discount": {"type": "PERCENT_OFF", "percentOff": 5},
 "categories": ["audio", "toasters"], "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
 "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true, "priority": 21}

### A window that ends before it starts: 400, naming validUntil
POST {{promotions}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Backwards", "discount": {"type": "PERCENT_OFF", "percentOff": 5},
 "validFrom": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true, "priority": 22}

### Switch it off: replace every field but the ID; state off
PUT {{promotions}}/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Phone weekend", "discount": {"type": "AMOUNT_OFF", "amountOff": {"amountMinor": 500, "currency": "EUR"}},
 "categories": ["phones"], "minimumSubtotal": {"amountMinor": 20000, "currency": "EUR"},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": false, "priority": 20}

### A Customer can't see Campaigns: 403
GET {{promotions}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Through the gateway, Staff reach Campaigns
GET {{gateway}}/api/promotions/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Delete it: 204, then 404
DELETE {{promotions}}/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###
GET {{promotions}}/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Every Discount an audio line is due, with no Coupon: the seeded Audio week, 15% off
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "AUD-AIRPODS-PRO-2", "sku": "AUD-AIRPODS-PRO-2", "category": "audio",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 27900, "currency": "EUR"}}]}

### Audio week, then WELCOME10 on what is left: 41.85, then 23.71
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "AUD-AIRPODS-PRO-2", "sku": "AUD-AIRPODS-PRO-2", "category": "audio",
            "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": {"amountMinor": 27900, "currency": "EUR"}}],
 "couponCode": "WELCOME10"}
